:["CVE-2001-0385"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:12Z","remediation":"升级 GoAhead WebServer 到 v2.1.5 以上版本，该漏洞在后续版本中已修复对 Windows 保留设备名 `/aux` 的请求处理。如无法升级，可在 Web 服务器前端部署反向代理（如 Nginx）并配置规则拦截对 `/aux`、`/con`、`/nul` 等 Windows 保留设备名的 HTTP 请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0281.html","http://freecode.com/projects/embedthis-goahead-webserver/releases/343539","http://osvdb.org/81099","http://www.osvdb.org/6664","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2607","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6400","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20770","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0385.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9342e5394ee109ffc3617b5105797cdfcfcb78cf/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0385.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0385","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2001.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0385.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-897g-vr3x-p6c9/GHSA-897g-vr3x-p6c9.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2607/info.html","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/ade01d2e0e3b718f00ee8257bccf82b519181ac8/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-15xx/CVE-2003-1569.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0385.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0157.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0157.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0156","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0156.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0384","title":"Siemens Reliant UNIX ppd 竞争条件漏洞","description":"Siemens Reliant UNIX 5.4 系统中的 ppd 工具存在竞争条件漏洞。当 ppd 以 -T 选项运行时，会在 /tmp 目录下创建不安全的临时文件 ppd.trace，未对文件路径进行原子化检查。本地攻击者可通过预先创建符号链接指向目标系统文件，利用时间窗口诱导程序以特权身份覆写任意文件，导致系统文件完整性受损或权限提升。该漏洞攻击复杂度较低，但需本地访问权限。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0384"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:12Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响已停止支持的 Siemens Reliant UNIX 5.4，厂商已不再提供安全更新。建议立即升级至受支持的操作系统（如现代 Linux 发行版）。临时缓解措施：移除 ppd 程序的 setuid/setgid 权限（`chmod u-s /usr/bin/ppd`），并限制仅受信用户可本地登录系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/176709","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2606","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20769","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/362345baaa3b0376b2369a7901885756e250334b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0384.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0384","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0384.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0384.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8377-ghcg-3gw2/GHSA-8377-ghcg-3gw2.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2606/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0384.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--8edfd27a-6917-4f49-86a5-ba126c2d091a.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0156.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0156.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0156.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0102","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0102.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0262","title":"Netscape SmartDownload 1.3 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Netscape SmartDownload 1.3 存在远程缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过构造恶意网页并诱导用户访问，向该组件提交超长 URL 参数触发缓冲区溢出，从而在目标系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Netscape SmartDownload 1.3 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议用户升级至最新版本或停止使用该组件。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0262"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:59Z","remediation":"Netscape SmartDownload 1.3 及其依赖的 Netscape 浏览器已停止维护超过 20 年，官方不再提供安全补丁。建议立即卸载 Netscape SmartDownload 组件并升级至 Mozilla Firefox、Google Chrome 等现代浏览器。作为临时缓解措施，避免使用旧版 Netscape 浏览器访问不可信网站，并在浏览器安全设置中禁用自动下载执行插件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2001/a041301-1.txt","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20775","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0262.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0262","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0262.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/affa68d6539dbc90b6b6e0e1e746facb4aae08df/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0262.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8cj5-765m-4mc8/GHSA-8cj5-765m-4mc8.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0262.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2615/info.html","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0102.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0102.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0102.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0096","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0096.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0239","title":"Microsoft ISA Server 2000 Web Proxy 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Security and Acceleration (ISA) Server 2000 的 Web 代理组件存在输入验证缺陷，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过发送特制的超长 Web 请求触发该漏洞，导致 Web 代理服务崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 ISA Server 2000 所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危。受影响的系统需要安装安全更新或限制可提交的请求长度以缓解风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0239"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:56Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS01-016 提供的补丁程序，或升级至 ISA Server 2000 Service Pack 1 及以上版本。也可在 ISA Server 管理控制台中，配置 Web 请求筛选规则，限制单次请求的最大 URL 长度以缓解攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references