:true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0096.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0161","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0161.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0400","title":"nph-maillist CGI 邮件列表管理脚本 email address 参数 shell 元字符注入漏洞","description":"nph-maillist CGI 脚本（3.0/3.5 版本）对用户提交的电子邮件地址未做任何过滤处理，攻击者可在 email 字段中插入反引号等 shell 元字符，导致任意操作系统命令被注入并执行。未经身份认证的远程攻击者仅需构造恶意 HTTP 请求即可利用此漏洞，完全控制目标 Web 服务器。该漏洞利用难度低、影响严重。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0400"],"sources":["cve","exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-02T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 nph-maillist 至 3.5.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复邮件地址字段中反引号等 shell 元字符的过滤缺陷。如厂商已停止维护，建议彻底移除 nph-maillist 组件，改用受支持的邮件列表软件（如 Mailman 3），并在 Web 服务器层面对 CGI 目录禁用特殊字符传递作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/175506","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2563","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20744","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/56b9e9b42ce0a91a448094549973b81cdf8e832e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0400.json"],"poc_urls":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20744"],"exp_urls":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20744"],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0161.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0161.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0161.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0381","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0381.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1246","title":"PHP PHP 4.x SafeMode 任意文件执行漏洞","description":"PHP 4.x 的 SafeMode（安全模式）存在任意文件执行漏洞。由于 safe_mode 对文件操作函数的权限检查不完善，攻击者可通过构造特制的 PHP 脚本绕过安全模式限制，在目标服务器上执行任意系统命令或读取敏感文件。该漏洞影响 PHP 4.x 全系列版本，攻击者只需能够上传 PHP 文件或控制部分文件内容即可触发利用，危害较大。官方已在后续版本中修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1246"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-30T00:00:00Z","updated":"2001-06-30T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 PHP 至 4.1.2 或更高版本（官方下载 php-4.1.2.tar.gz），该版本修复了 mail() 函数第 5 个参数未正确过滤 shell 元字符的问题。Red Hat 用户可安装 RHSA-2002-102/RHSA-2002-129/RHSA-2003-159 安全更新。临时缓解措施：在 php.ini 中设置 safe_mode=Off 或通过 disable_functions 禁用 mail() 函数。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20985","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3fc46d7716e9a0dd9635d13e2bff8fffb122a860/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1246.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1246","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1246.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/73cd39be077fdbedc5ca2ea7e2723723d25285cc/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1246.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7pf5-hfgr-ch72/GHSA-7pf5-hfgr-ch72.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/redhat-RHSA-2002-129.nasl","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1246.md","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/invicti/vulnerabilities/db/vulnerabilities/vdb/2001/1xxx/cve-2001-1246.yaml","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/mandrake_MDKSA-2002-059.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_0_100.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0381.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0381.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0381.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0510","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0510.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1290","title":"Active Classifieds Free Edition 1.0 任意代码执行漏洞","description":"Active Classifieds Free Edition 1.0 的管理后台 admin.cgi 脚本存在任意代码执行漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 table_width 参数传递特制的 Perl 代码，利用该参数未经过滤直接传入 eval 或类似函数执行的缺陷，实现任意 Perl 代码执行。成功利用后攻击者可修改系统配置、提升权限至 Web 服务器级别，进而完全控制目标站点。该漏洞影响 Active Classifieds Free Edition 1.0 及可能存在的商业版本，Exploit-DB 已公开完整利用代码，攻击门槛极低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1290"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-28T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:58Z","remediation":"立即停止使用 Active Classifieds Free Edition 1.0，该软件已停止维护且无安全补丁。如必须继续使用，应在 Web 服务器层面限制对 admin.cgi 的访问（如仅允许特定 IP 通过 .htaccess 或 Nginx/Apache 访问控制），并对 table_width 参数实施严格的输入过滤，禁止传入分号、引号等 Perl 特殊字符。强烈建议迁移至其他仍在维护的分类广告系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-06/0386.html","http://www.osvdb.org/12326","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2942","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6754","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20982","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1290.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1290","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1290.md","https://github.com/CPAN-Security/cpan-advisory-database/blob/bc9ed2336eeed09f48acb0a64fd37970dc5a31d6/triage/CVE-2001-1290.yml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/06bd4bafa29f2b5ddfa107ad565d92d39b9a40e1/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1290.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r48r-qqwp-vgcg/GHSA-r48r-qqwp-vgcg.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1290.md","https://github.com/briandfoy/cpan-security-advisory/blob/1df5657bcf9bbd7f7eb8b57fb483ac0dc8aa652a/TO_DO","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2942/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151000_151100.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0510.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0510.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0510.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0277","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0277.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0496","title":"KDE kdesu 权限提升漏洞","description":"该漏洞存在于KDE的kdesu组件中，核心问题在于kdesu在创建临时文件时未设置严格文件权限，导致临时文件对任意用户可读。该临时文件存储了用户名、密码等关键认证凭证。攻击者仅需本地访问目标系统，即可读取这些临时文件获取系统认证信息，进而实现权限提升攻击。该漏洞影响范围广泛，涵盖所有使用旧版kdesu组件的Linux系统，攻击门槛较低且成功率较高。攻击者通常通过编写简单脚本获取临时文件读取权限，提取其中的认证信息，利用这些凭证进行系统权限提升或进一步攻击。该漏洞反映了软件开发中临时文件权限处理不当的典型安全问题，已成为Linux权限提升攻击中常见的利用手段之一。该漏洞最早于2001年披露，影响当时主流Linux发行版中的KDE桌面环境组件。建议升级到Mandrake Linux MDKSA-2001:046或Red Hat RHSA-2001:059提供的安全补丁版本，或改用支持ACL权限管理的替代su方法，禁用kdesu临时文件认证方式。CVSS评分4.6，严重程度为中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0496"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-06-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:24Z","remediation":"升级 kdesu 到 Mandrake Linux MDKSA-2001:046 或 Red Hat RHSA-2001:059 中提供的安全补丁版本，修复临时文件权限设置漏洞。如无法立即更新，建议切换到 ACL 权限管理的替代 su 方法，禁用 kdesu 临时文件认证或使用既有 root 密码直接 sudo 命令认证，并在使用过程中通过 `sudo -A` 避免临时文件泄露。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-046.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-059.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6856","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0496.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0496","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0496.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1910cec3a272a9634d53e73996abe765ad48da86/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0496.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-283r-9v3h-5q9m/GHSA-283r-9v3h-5q9m.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88852/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151000_151100.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mandrake_MDKSA-2001-046.nasl","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0496.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0277.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0275","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0275.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0489","title":"gFTP FTP客户端 格式化字符串远程代码执行漏洞","description":"gFTP FTP 客户端在 2.0.8 之前版本中存在格式字符串漏洞，该漏洞源于软件在处理恶意 FTP 服务器响应时，未正确验证格式字符串参数，导致攻击者可通过精心构造的格式化字符串（如 %n、%s 等格式控制符）控制程序内存读写。远程未经认证的攻击者可搭建恶意 FTP 服务器，诱导受害者使用受影响版本的 gFTP 客户端连接，通过发送包含恶意格式字符串的 FTP 响应数据（如文件列表、欢迎消息等），实现远程任意代码执行。该漏洞影响运行 Linux/Unix 系统且使用 gFTP 2.0.8 之前版本的所有用户，攻击者无需身份验证即可远程触发，CVSS 评分 7.5（HIGH，AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:P/I:P/A:P），对系统机密性、完整性和可用性均造成部分影响。该漏洞已在 gFTP 2.0.8 版本中修复，用户应立即升级至 2.0.8 或更高版本，或应用 Debian DSA-057 等发行版提供的安全补丁。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0489"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-06-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:24Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 gftp 到 2.0.8 或更高版本，或通过包管理器安装 Debian DSA-057 安全更新（apt-get update && apt-get upgrade gftp）。如无法立即升级，请避免连接不可信的 FTP 服务器，或在防火墙层面限制仅允许连接受信任的 FTP 服务器 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/linux/redhat/2001-q2/0043.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vuln-dev/2001-q2/0231.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-057","http://www.osvdb.org/1805","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2657","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6478","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0489.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0489","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0489.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0489.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-057.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vrqv-jfm9-wq9q/GHSA-vrqv-jfm9-wq9q.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0489.json","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2001/dsa-057.data","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151000_151100.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0275.toml"}]